-1mmgt6o" style="min-height:250px;filter:unset"><div id="div-gpt-ad-1711440066994-0"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hightligth"><div class="img-hightligth bg-zoom-loop"><div class="widget-logo fade-in-bottom css-mecuwr"><div class="display-flex"><img class="img-icon" src="https://media.nationthailand.com/images/3.0/ico-news-light.svg" width="65" height="65" alt="no-article" title="no-article"/><p class="text-icon">news</p></div><div class="display-flex"><p class="text-description">Thailand : Thailand&#39;s most updated English news website, thai news, thailand news, Bangkok thailand, aec,newspaper english, breaking news : The Nation.</p></div></div></div></div><div id="section-1" class="container section-1"><div class="wrapper-1"><div class="card-body hover-zoom  css-1q9r4qa"><a role="link" href="/news/tourism/40072421" aria-label="October 17, 2026 Laem Son National Park opens fully to visitors in Ranong" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Laem Son National Park opens fully to visitors in Ranong" tabindex="-1"><div class="card-image "><div class="lazyload-wrapper "><div class="lazyload-placeholder"></div></div></div><h3 class="title font-poppins line-clamp --2">Laem Son National Park opens fully to visitors in Ranong</h3><div class="card-footer"><div class="published-date"><small><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M18 2H6c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v18l8-4.572L20 22V4c0-1.103-.897-2-2-2zm0 16.553-6-3.428-6 3.428V4h12v14.553z"></path></svg>October 17, 2026</small></div><p class="font-buenard blurb line-clamp --3">Laem Son National Park in Ranong offers coral snorkelling, sunset camping at Bang Ben Beach and overnight stays in tents on Ko Kam Tok.</p></div></a></div><div class="card-body hover-zoom  css-1q9r4qa"><a role="link" href="/news/world/40072417" aria-label="October 17, 2026 Trump waives key Russia sanctions and tariffs before they take effect" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Trump waives key Russia sanctions and tariffs before they take effect" tabindex="-1"><div class="card-image "><div class="lazyload-wrapper "><div class="lazyload-placeholder"></div></div></div><h3 class="title font-poppins line-clamp --2">Trump waives key Russia sanctions and tariffs before they take effect</h3><div class="card-footer"><div class="published-date"><small><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M18 2H6c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v18l8-4.572L20 22V4c0-1.103-.897-2-2-2zm0 16.553-6-3.428-6 3.428V4h12v14.553z"></path></svg>October 17, 2026</small></div><p class="font-buenard blurb line-clamp --3">US President Donald Trump has waived sweeping new sanctions and tariffs targeting Russia and buyers of its energy, saying the move serves US national interests.</p></div></a></div></div></div><div id="section-2" class="container section-2"><section id="related" class="css-8l9yim"><div class="css-hfjy40"><div class="divider text-start"><div class="divider-text"><div class="h-3 text-header fw-semibold font-poppins">Related</div></div></div></div><div class="articles-relate"><div><div class="card-body hover-zoom  css-1q9r4qa"><a role="link" href="/news/general/40072414" aria-label="October 17, 2026 Georgieva to Thailand: &#x27;You Showed Us the Very Best of Your Country&#x27;" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Georgieva to Thailand: &#x27;You Showed Us the Very Best of Your Country&#x27;" tabindex="-1"><div class="card-image "><div class="lazyload-wrapper "><div class="lazyload-placeholder"></div></div></div><h3 class="title font-poppins line-clamp --2">Georgieva to Thailand: &#x27;You Showed Us the Very Best of Your Country&#x27;</h3><div class="card-footer"><div class="published-date"><small>October 17, 2026</small></div></div></a></div></div><div><div class="card-body hover-zoom  cs